      "message": "\u003e Done, addressed in patchset 4.\n\nPlease reply to the comments in the gerrit UI directly to close them. Was this reply sent from email? I noticed this in changes from other users as well and am trying to understand why the reply is at file level rather than to the (still open) comment.",
